                                        "sense_id": "865153ee-78e7-379a-b8ce-179eb6ec15f1",
                                        "entry_id": "71b51790-c22e-3301-9d21-4643811e8ba8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who lays anything, such as tiles or a wager."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19039f9f-e8a2-42c8-b617-80df287ff256",
                                                "sense_id": "865153ee-78e7-379a-b8ce-179eb6ec15f1",
                                                "text": "If fortune ever favoured any venturesome layer of bets, Tom Elliot was certainly the one that day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16674d11-5d88-3f71-8cd3-cf2a0ba3c03f",
                                        "entry_id": "71b51790-c22e-3301-9d21-4643811e8ba8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mature female bird, insect, etc. that is able to lay eggs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c53d8a56-2575-4dcc-9f05-4659c04e30d8",
                                                "sense_id": "16674d11-5d88-3f71-8cd3-cf2a0ba3c03f",
                                                "text": "As for which hen we'll cull for next Sunday's dinner, we certainly won't eat Henrietta yet — she's still a prime layer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a53f9d1b-4a6e-4426-ba8c-2d576ab8dca1",
                                                "sense_id": "16674d11-5d88-3f71-8cd3-cf2a0ba3c03f",
                                                "text": "When dealing with an infestation of headlice, the first step is to eliminate the layers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "529930fd-90d6-3596-9504-7689fb701e85",
                                        "entry_id": "71b51790-c22e-3301-9d21-4643811e8ba8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mature female bird, insect, etc. that is able to lay eggs.",
                                            "A hen kept to lay eggs; a breed of chicken bred to maximize laying output."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "439eabfd-bfa0-4af8-8983-74eccb8a529d",
                                                "sense_id": "529930fd-90d6-3596-9504-7689fb701e85",
                                                "text": "“Mrs. Boast can’t have got all these from one hatching,” [Ma] said. “I do believe there’s not more than two cockerels among them.” “The Boasts have got such a head-start with chickens, likely they’re planning to eat friers this summer,” said Pa. “It may be she took a few cockerels out of this flock, looking on them as meat.” “Yes, and replaced them with pullets that will be layers,” Ma guessed. “It would be Mrs. Boast all over. A more generous woman never lived.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9727c090-56e7-46c2-8475-ae86e8b11dd1",
                                                "sense_id": "529930fd-90d6-3596-9504-7689fb701e85",
                                                "text": "We keep a flock of layers and flock of broilers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
